# CIRPASS-2 EUDPP Core Ontology — upstream mirror (v2.0.5, issued 2026-07-06).
# Verbatim merge of the published module exports (Semantic Treehouse,
# dpp.vocabulary-hub.eu, via the w3id.org/eudpp redirects); upstream IRIs preserved,
# nothing rebranded. Generated by scripts/sync-eudpp.ts (pnpm run sync:eudpp).
# Modules: EU DPP CORE (2.0.5); EU DPP CO ACTOR (2.0.0); EU DPP CORE CONNECTOR (2.0); Event module (Version 0.1.0 DRAFT); EU DPP IDENT (1.0.5); EU DPP MAT (1.0.2); EU DPP CO P_DPP (2.0.0); EU DPP SOC (2.0.0); EU DPP CO COMP (1.0.0); EU DPP LCA (2.0).
