<https://w3id.org/eudpp/ACTOR> a owl:Ontology;
    dcterms:contributor "Hele-Mai Haav"@en, "Tarmo Robal"@en;
    dcterms:creator "Riina Maigre"@en;
    dcterms:description "Actor module of an EU DPP core ontology proposal of the CIRPASS-2 European project.\n\nDEPENDENCIES:  This module has dependencies to the following EU DPP Core Ontology modules: CON, P_DPP, EVENT.  \n\nFor more information, see \nMaigre, R., Haav, H.-M., Robal, T., Wolf, M.-A., &amp; Danash, F. (2025). Ontology Requirements Specification for an EU DPP Core Ontology Proposal (1.1). CIRPASS-2 Consortium. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15270342\n\n=======================\nCHANGES FEB 2026\n1. Applied CEON-inspired design principles.\n2. Modelled several Actor properties using schema.org properties, such as address, email, telephone, url, geo.\n3. Changed Role class hierarchy.\n\nCHANGES APRIL 2026\n1. Moved identifier logic to connector.\n2. Fixed AutorisedRepresentativeRoleAssignment name (previously AutorisedRepresentationAssignment).\n        "@en;
    dcterms:issued "2025-03-14";
    dcterms:title "Actors and roles module for an EU DPP core ontology proposed by CIRPASS-2 European project."@en;
    rdfs:comment "The Actor module of an EU DPP core ontology proposed by the CIRPASS-2 European project."@en;
