eudpp:DigitalInstruction a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "Digital instructions\nmean instructions in digital format concerning the product (‘digital instructions’) in a language that can be easily understood. ESPR Art 27(7)\nDigital instructions are ensured by manufacturers. These should also ensured by importers. (ESPR Art 29(4))\n\nThis class can be extended/specialised according to delegated acts or industry standards."@en;
    rdfs:label "DigitalInstruction"@en;
    dcterms:references "ESPR Art 27(7)"@en;
